    "text": "The results are in! We had 71 votes from 22 users, and these are the results (click to reveal them):\n\nBest Children's Game\n#1: Buffalo Buffalo Buffalo Buffalo Buffalo by Scholle80\n#2: VLKNO by RPMgamer\n#3: Mushroom Mages by bhr_79\n#4: Bramblewood Bash by malnord\n#5: The Tortoise & The Hare by RPMgamer\n#6: Alley Cat Ninjas by Wildcard Six\n#7: Wallaby by formikaio\n#8: Geleé on tour! by RichardGOJ\n#9: New Choice: Improv Your Life! by KarenLyu\n#10: Build a Playground with Bill & Gary by XendoBreckett\n\nBest Family Game\n\n#2: Buffalo Buffalo Buffalo Buffalo Buffalo by Scholle80\n#3: VLKNO by RPMgamer\n#4: Mushroom Mages by bhr_79\n#5: Bramblewood Bash by malnord\n#6: Alley Cat Ninjas by Wildcard Six\n#7: Wallaby by formikaio\n#8: Forbidden Finals by shavelevandrey\n#9: Pixel Golf by ddavidd\n#10: Geleé on tour! by RichardGOJ\n#11: Chariots of Dice by Tiberius Gracchus\n#12: Save the Moon-eyed Loris by Raze4646\n\nCongratulations to the winners, and all the designers who entered their work in the contest.\n\nThanks to everyone who voted, gave feedback or just commented a little. \n\nSee you all next year!",
    "tokens": "\nThe results are in! We had 71 votes from 22 users, and these are the results (click to reveal them):\n\nBest Children's Game\n\n\n\n\n\n\n#1: Buffalo Buffalo Buffalo Buffalo Buffalo by \nScholle80\n#2: VLKNO by \nRPMgamer\n#3: Mushroom Mages by \nbhr_79\n#4: Bramblewood Bash by \nmalnord\n#5: The Tortoise & The Hare by \nRPMgamer\n#6: Alley Cat Ninjas by \nWildcard Six\n#7: Wallaby by \nformikaio\n#8: Geleé on tour! by \nRichardGOJ\n#9: New Choice: Improv Your Life! by \nKarenLyu\n#10: Build a Playground with Bill & Gary by \nXendoBreckett\n\nBest Family Game\n\n\n\n\n\n\n#1: Joy's Bakery by \nlottysnake\n#2: Buffalo Buffalo Buffalo Buffalo Buffalo by \nScholle80\n#3: VLKNO by \nRPMgamer\n#4: Mushroom Mages by \nbhr_79\n#5: Bramblewood Bash by \nmalnord\n#6: Alley Cat Ninjas by \nWildcard Six\n#7: Wallaby by \nformikaio\n#8: Forbidden Finals by \nshavelevandrey\n#9: Pixel Golf by \nddavidd\n#10: Geleé on tour! by \nRichardGOJ\n#11: Chariots of Dice by \nTiberius Gracchus\n#12: Save the Moon-eyed Loris by \nRaze4646\n\nCongratulations to the winners, and all the designers who entered their work in the contest.\n\nThanks to everyone who voted, gave feedback or just commented a little.  [IMG:🙂] \n\nSee you all next year!",
